From 3ba29e7f0d3523736fc976b982000e3532661e0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 07:49:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 129/172] fixup! media: amlogic: amvdec: add HEVC decoding

Accept the initial HEVC long-term RPS value:
Dynamic array controls start with one element, and try_ctrl rejects
any EXT_SPS_LT_RPS value that has elements, so the control's own
initial value fails VIDIOC_TRY_EXT_CTRLS and v4l2-compliance reports:

  fail: v4l2-test-controls.cpp(939): try_ext_ctrls returned an error (22)

The table is never used: the SPS check refuses a non-zero
num_long_term_ref_pics_sps and the request path refuses a request that
carries the table. Drop the try_ctrl check.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
Signed-off-by: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec.c | 4 ----
 1 file changed, 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec.c b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec.c
index fa747a0efdf6..51e1313d8574 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec.c
@@ -1028,9 +1028,6 @@ static int amvdec_hevc_try_ctrl(struct v4l2_ctrl *ctrl)
 		kfree(resolved);
 		return ret;
 	}
-	case V4L2_CID_STATELESS_HEVC_EXT_SPS_LT_RPS:
-		/* The primary image does not implement the SPS LT table ABI. */
-		return ctrl->new_elems ? -EINVAL : 0;
 	default:
 		return 0;
 	}
@@ -1217,7 +1214,6 @@ static int vdec_init_ctrls(struct amvdec_session *sess)
 				.dims = { HEVC_RPS_MAX_SETS },
 			}, {
 				.id = V4L2_CID_STATELESS_HEVC_EXT_SPS_LT_RPS,
-				.ops = &amvdec_hevc_ctrl_ops,
 				.flags = V4L2_CTRL_FLAG_DYNAMIC_ARRAY,
 				.dims = { 32 },
 			}, {
-- 
